# Archived plan

Fixture file, standing in for a document under planning/archive/. It sits one
level below the cite-dir, so a scan that stops at the cite-dir's own depth never
sees it.

**conventions** — old-name

Rewriting an archived document is a deliberate, documented consequence of not
excluding archive/ from the scan: half a rename is the worse failure.
